CeladonCity_Hotel_Text_ThisHotelIsForPeople::
    .string "This hotel is\n"
    .string "for people.\n"
    .string "Not for Pokemon.\n"
    .string "We're full up anyway.\p"
    .string "Something tried to\n"
    .string "check in last\n"
    .string "Thursday.\n"
    .string "No reservation.\p"
    .string "It left marks\n"
    .string "at the entrance.\p"
    .string "We haven't fixed them.$"

CeladonCity_Hotel_Text_OnVacationWithBrotherAndBoyfriend::
    .string "I'm here on\n"
    .string "vacation with my\n"
    .string "little brother and\n"
    .string "my boyfriend.\p"
    .string "We saw something\n"
    .string "large move through\n"
    .string "the street below\n"
    .string "last night.\p"
    .string "We checked the\n"
    .string "news.\n"
    .string "Nothing reported.\p"
    .string "ProtoGlyph doesn't make\n"
    .string "the news yet.$"

CeladonCity_Hotel_Text_WhyDidSheBringBrother::
    .string "Why did she\n"
    .string "bring her little brother?\p"
    .string "Also.\p"
    .string "What made those\n"
    .string "marks in the\n"
    .string "pavement outside.\p"
    .string "They weren't there\n"
    .string "yesterday.$"

CeladonCity_Hotel_Text_SisBroughtMeOnVacation::
    .string "Yippee!\n"
    .string "My sis brought\n"
    .string "me along!\p"
    .string "I saw a\n"
    .string "big stone thing\n"
    .string "walk past the\n"
    .string "window last night!\p"
    .string "Everybody said I\n"
    .string "was dreaming.\p"
    .string "I wasn't dreaming.$"

